#. macro: <if ($n1 < 120)>Less than 2 minutes<else><if ($n1 < 180)>Less than 3 minutes<else><if ($n1 < 300)>Less than 5 minutes<else><if ($n1 < 600)>Less than 10 minutes<… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 < 120 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
